/ Atelier (#208) : « une date, un descriptif, vous pouvez y mettre des notes,
/ combien ça coûte » — plus les animateurs, dont dépend la répartition.
= form_with model: [ :admin, workshop ], local: true, class: "adm-card p-4 sm:p-6 space-y-5" do |f|
  - if workshop.errors.any?
    .rounded-md.p-4 style="background: var(--danger-100); border: 1px solid var(--danger-200);"
      h2.text-sm.font-semibold style="color: var(--danger-700);" Correction requise
      ul.mt-2.list-disc.space-y-1.pl-5.text-sm style="color: var(--danger-700);"
        - workshop.errors.full_messages.each do |message|
          li = message

  .grid.grid-cols-1.gap-4 class="md:grid-cols-3"
    div
      = f.label :held_on, "Date", class: "adm-eyebrow mb-1 block"
      = f.date_field :held_on, class: adm_field_class, required: true
    div class="md:col-span-2"
      = f.label :title, "Intitulé", class: "adm-eyebrow mb-1 block"
      = f.text_field :title, class: adm_field_class, required: true, placeholder: "Ex. Atelier pain au levain"

  div
    = f.label :description, "Descriptif", class: "adm-eyebrow mb-1 block"
    = f.text_area :description, rows: 3, class: adm_field_class

  div
    = f.label :notes, "Notes internes", class: "adm-eyebrow mb-1 block"
    = f.text_area :notes, rows: 3, class: adm_field_class
    p.mt-1.text-xs style="color: var(--text-muted);" Pour l'équipe : matériel, contraintes, participants attendus…

  div
    = f.label :revenue_euros, "Recette (€)", class: "adm-eyebrow mb-1 block"
    = f.text_field :revenue_euros, value: workshop.revenue_euros, class: adm_field_class, placeholder: "0,00"

  .rounded-md.p-4 style="background: var(--surface-inset); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);"
    span.adm-eyebrow.mb-2.block Qui anime cet atelier ?
    p.mb-3.text-xs style="color: var(--text-muted);"
      | La répartition suit exactement les mêmes règles que la production : part de chaque animateur selon son pourcentage configuré, puis mise en commun par partenariat. Un atelier sans animateur est enregistré mais signalé comme non réparti.
    - if artisans.any?
      .grid.grid-cols-1.gap-2 class="sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"
        = f.collection_check_boxes :artisan_ids, artisans, :id, :name do |b|
          label.adm-option.flex.cursor-pointer.items-center.gap-2.rounded-md.px-3.py-2 style="border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);"
            = b.check_box style: "accent-color: var(--brand);"
            span.text-sm.font-medium style="color: var(--text-body);" = b.text
    - else
      p.text-sm style="color: var(--text-muted);" Aucun artisan actif.

  .flex.flex-wrap.justify-end.gap-3
    = link_to "Annuler", admin_workshops_path, class: adm_btn_class(:default)
    = f.submit submit_label, class: adm_btn_class(:primary)
